{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f55c9fe7c06915234d72aa37a11723b5b57555898c49c2b46ebe2868943a3d5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f817cfd7fb9a5c19e50016d60fd97b5f152148d7fd4b26c2e805c771447fe41",
      "text": "天空仍未止息吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398d8a3fc6afefcdc0e296ad690bb404d9a93379396878ffab637b84fd7c0c5d",
      "text": "（……自那之后）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf481c2570e3627ce4e49e050ee58e4476a521bbcc2cf70f715d3cff2ea91de",
      "text": "（作为厨师辗转了许多店，\n却立即被废弃契约……抑或甚至未能结契）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76aad288366783a2ad47f33f78212a1099be7e128cd8e79e3496255c46c14ae8",
      "text": "恶魔？供品？\n你在耍我吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8a699dd05c51dd326fcb434d5594c2fe1164b3eda13bdba87ccfb60ea5ec858",
      "text": "那个……我、我们店人手已经够了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8f6d9e84e475742a483283282a45f7b1deffa2b4fb9daea1b5573a95e79b6d",
      "text": "（皆不能理解吾）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c6285a4fee7570e89233d9ad05150d1978335b345208bb24c15711a7a8fdada",
      "text": "（说来……吾与师尊邂逅之时，\n亦是如此受困于孤独之刻啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b18e4e27c6655d76ba67b082af089d2cba93210fee5c5999f1e07c975f43cb65",
      "text": "（……肚子好饿啊。\n得快点去买饭才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cffe870d4f174761e6aed442ffe0e2800c0066b1323751065ed2bd7e09f3ac3a",
      "text": "……？哇，好香的味道。\n是从这家餐厅传出来的……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe43fd106beab79fda346e93b0a89013e8c49e58621f12fd1e00a80407227fe1",
      "text": "汝在此处作甚，小家伙。\n……汝之名为何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_01_1_1_010_01:1_1_010_01_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4835aa8aa5667375db3c022fb831c357a315223c30a93dddbb78dda46fa58563",
      "text": "……\n太郎……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
